{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28313-layoffs-at-ccp","id":28313,"title":"Layoffs at CCP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-11T14:45:48-08:00","id":28313,"title":"Layoffs at CCP","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Very sorry to hear that a round of layoffs has hit the World of Darkness MMO development office. <br /> <br /> &quot;CCP today made strategic adjustments to the staffing on the team working on the </span></span><i>World of Darkness</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">project in Atlanta that resulted in the elimination of approximately 15 positions at the company. The change was due to our evaluation of the game's design and ongoing development needs. While this was a difficult decision, CCP remains committed to the franchise and our promise to make a compelling, rich, and deep </span></span><i>World of Darkness</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> experience.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/ </a> </div> <div cl